    <div style="font-size:13px;color:#1a2332;line-height:1.5;margin-top:6px;">13 leads from $1,595 across 10 ads. Blended CPL: $123. 6 ads spent $449 with zero leads.</div>
</div><div class="cards-grid"><div class="card">
    <div class="card-header">
        <div class="ad-name">Carousel Static | Early Years OH | Ad #1 Long | May 06 2026</div>
        <div class="campaign-name" title="Warp | Bofu | Conversions - Cold | SG | 0/01/2026">Warp | Bofu | Conversions - Cold | SG | 0/01/2026</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card-thumbnail"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Carousel Static | Early Years OH | Ad #1 Long | May 06 2026" loading="lazy"></div>
